###  https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/foundation#Indexed
fnd:Indexed rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual , fnd:DerivationKind ;
    rdfs:label "Indexed"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A lookup structure generated over source content." .

###  https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/foundation#Generated
fnd:Generated rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual , fnd:DerivationKind ;
